config ANALOG_LIGHT
	bool "Generic analog light sensor"
	depends on DT_HAS_ZEPHYR_ANALOG_LIGHT_ENABLED
	select ADC
	help
	  Enable a generic ADC-backed light sensor. The driver samples an ADC
	  input and maps the configured voltage range to SENSOR_CHAN_LIGHT as a
	  0-100 relative light level.
